[ 2 POW SQRT ] 'S0C.ABS' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V SORT 'S' BIND V LENGTH 'N' BIND S N 1 SUB 2 DIV FLOOR GET S N 2 DIV FLOOR GET ADD 2 DIV ] 'S0C.MEDIAN' DEF
[ 'SC' BIND 'IT' BIND SC 0 GET 'F' BIND SC F [ MAX ] FOLD 'M' BIND IT SC 2 COLLECT ZIP [ 1 GET M EQ ] FILTER 0 GET 0 GET ] 'S0C.ARGFIRST' DEF
[ [ ' ' 2 COLLECT ] MAP FLATTEN JOIN TRIM ] 'S0C.SPJOIN' DEF
[ 'W' BIND W CHARS 'C' BIND C 0 GET UPPER C 1 DROP JOIN 2 COLLECT JOIN ] 'S0C.CAPW' DEF
[ 3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6 ]
'V' BIND V -2 DROP V 1 DROP -1 DROP ADD V 2 DROP ADD 3 DIV
